  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "turkish-raw-text-cleaned",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTurkish Raw Text Cleaned\n\t\n\nturkish-raw-text-cleaned, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e dil modeli \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131 i\u00e7in haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015f temizlenmi\u015f ham metin veri k\u00fcmesidir. Veri k\u00fcmesi, turkish-nlp-suite \u00e7at\u0131s\u0131 alt\u0131nda yay\u0131mlanan T\u00fcrk\u00e7e metin kaynaklar\u0131n\u0131n temizlenmesi, filtrelenmesi ve model e\u011fitimine daha uygun hale getirilmesiyle olu\u015fturulmu\u015ftur.\nBu \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma \u00f6zellikle T\u00fcrk\u00e7e LLM \u00f6n-e\u011fitimi, continual pre-training (CPT), tokenizer analizi, embedding modeli e\u011fitimi, alan ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z T\u00fcrk\u00e7e metin modelleme ve veri\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/serda-dev/turkish-raw-text-cleaned.",
